			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Regenerate build artifacts and route manifest\n\nExecute a full rebuild of the Cocoon extension host sidecar to capture the latest repository state. Update the `RouteManifest` metadata with a new generation timestamp while maintaining the current set of 118 registered Mountain RPC methods and 1 bespoke Node fallback.\n\nRegenerate all TypeScript build artifacts in the `Target/` directory, including the compiled JavaScript entry points (`Main.js`, `Bootstrap.js`, `RPCServer.js`), gRPC server service definitions, and VS Code API handlers. Source maps and the incremental build cache (`tsconfig.tsbuildinfo`) are refreshed to ensure accurate debugging support.",
