			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Regenerate build artifacts and route manifest\n\nExecute a full build of the Cocoon extension host sidecar to capture the latest state of the codebase. This commit updates the generated `RouteManifest` with a new timestamp and recompiles all TypeScript sources to JavaScript, including the gRPC server, request handlers, and VS Code API adapters.\n\nThe build artifacts in the `Target/` directory are updated to reflect the current repository state, ensuring the `RouteManifest` accurately registers the 118 available Mountain methods and the 1 bespoke Node fallback. Source maps and the TypeScript build cache are regenerated to support debugging and incremental builds.",
