			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Remove legacy RouteManifest and regenerate build artifacts\n\nDelete the deprecated `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.Report.md` and `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` source files, which have been superseded by the unified TypeScript build pipeline. Trigger a full rebuild of the Cocoon extension host sidecar to capture the current repository state.\n\nRegenerate all TypeScript build artifacts, source maps, and the `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` cache in the `Target/` directory. This ensures the compiled JavaScript entry points (`Main.js`, `Bootstrap.js`, `RPCServer.js`) and service handlers are synchronized with the latest source code and correctly reflect the active gRPC server configuration.",
